## Moonrise

@cyra{code="0010"}: I held the moon inside that lantern for a hundred winters. I think it's time to let it out.
@narrator{code="0010"}: She opens the lid. The moon climbs out slowly, like someone getting out of a warm bath, and rises full over the square.
@pim{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: CUSTOMERS!
@cyra{code="0020" emotion="happy"}: Happy harvest, Wishkeeper. Come find me on the Wishing Well. I'll be awake. Probably.
